@startuml

title Modern Service to Legacy SOAP Integration

participant "Modern Service" as Modern
participant "Integration Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Legacy SOAP System" as Legacy

Modern -> Adapter : Domain request
Adapter -> Adapter : Map domain → SOAP model
Adapter -> Legacy : SOAP/XML request
Legacy --> Adapter : SOAP response
Adapter -> Adapter : Map SOAP → domain model
Adapter --> Modern : Domain response

@enduml
